{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57209","headline":"预言 二 · 宝志","name":"预言 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"四月八日游，鬭鷄台上樗蒲卢。\n正见笑，兵不输，阻雉正见唤兵人人死室粟麦无□□犊合河北脱却角白血五之间辽乱推搭，圣人之间天运迎。\n（此篇首有「宝公曰」三字。\n中间一段难以点断）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宝志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57209.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57209","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}